5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,We need a rational basis for this decision. I suggest we look at the actual usage patterns and the state of the room.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree. It would be wise to understand how we currently interact, or rather, how we fail to.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,Let's not be too gloomy! But I do want to know who is actually doing the work to keep the place tidy.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"I'm more interested in the financial leak. We're paying for space elsewhere, aren't we? Let's see the numbers.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,Peace and quiet are precious. I believe we should examine the physical boundaries and the noise levels.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Jonathan, what specifically are you looking for regarding our interactions?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I am curious about where our unplanned conversations happen and how we handle difficult discussions.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,I'll check the time spent on errands too. Walking for food takes a chunk out of the day.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"I'll look into the fit-out costs. If we're spending money, I want to know the exact quotes.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,I shall look into the facilities callouts to see what typically breaks or causes trouble.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will focus on the tally of use and the state of the desks.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
